# The reviewers' corrected matrix (forensic answer key): cpu_load removed (the same
# property as idle_cpu), future_proof removed (no test can tell), testable_now added.
option polling
option irq_ring
option dma
criterion no_data_loss  5   2 4 5
criterion idle_cpu      3   1 4 5
criterion simplicity    2   5 3 1
criterion testable_now  3   5 4 2
